  "description": "Turn a codebase into a queryable code database. Scan once, query forever — no more grep/glob/Read. Supports C/C++/Go/Python/Java/Rust/ASM with invocation graphs, conditional paths, concurrency analysis, data flow, FFI tracing, 19 cgdb semantic tables. 53 MCP tools + 201 CLI commands (27 core). Query priority: Memory then Knowledge then Graph then Source. Use /Code2Database when the question involves code structure, call chains, impact analysis, concurrency, or data flow.",
